ification or other action of the President (1) the functions required by sections 1014(b) and 1014(d) of the Act [subsecs. (b) and (d) of this section] of transmitting to the Comptroller General of the United States and to the Office of the Federal Register copies of special messages transmitted pursuant to section 1012 or 1013 (2 U.S.C. 683 and 684) of the Act; and (2) the function conferred upon the President by section 1014(e) of the Act (2 U.S.C. 685","path":"jobs/current-law/output/USC_EO_NOTES.jsonl","sha256":"ac1e287b6b606b8adc5c1975f662aae2d31989c1d072e32c89dbc38f6efe8016","source":{"line":3,"path":"jobs/current-law/output/SOURCES.jsonl","record_sha256":"5b6e5de61be4ea9c9c4749827c02d0c9d484107505b7e9adae3172a42351c188"}}]}
